  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SL WAREHOUSE RECEIPTS FINANCING PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Project Development Objective (PDO) of the pilot Warehousing Receipts Financing Project is to provide access to farmers in the territory of the Recipient to quality storage facilities for agricultural products and to facilitate the use of such products as collateral to access financial services by developing an electronic and negotiable warehouse receipt financing program.</narrative>
  </description>
